web/public/models/fly-hi.glb and web/public/models/fly-lo.glb
  Derived from the fruit fly body model of flybody
  (https://github.com/TuragaLab/flybody, commit d015e9b), licensed under the
  Apache License, Version 2.0 (copy in web/public/models/LICENSE-flybody.txt).
  Changes: the MJCF body tree and OBJ meshes were placed in their body frames,
  simplified, given new texture coordinates and written as glTF with meshopt
  compression by pipeline/build_fly_model.py. Only files from the GitHub
  repository were used; nothing from the separately published datasets.
  Vaxenburg, R., Siwanowicz, I., Merel, J. et al. (2025). Whole-body physics
  simulation of fruit fly locomotion. Nature 643, 1312-1320.

web/public/textures/fly/
  Macro textures (compound eye, wing, thorax, abdomen) made for Connectome Lab
  from images generated by the author.

Neuron positions, skeletons and connectivity
  FlyWire (Dorkenwald et al. 2024; Schlegel et al. 2024), CC BY-NC 4.0.
  OpenWorm and Cook et al. 2019 for C. elegans. See each species.json.

